Description: High-performance personal AI assistant in C++17
 RavBot is a native C++ implementation of the OpenClaw ecosystem,
 built for performance and low memory footprint while staying fully
 compatible with OpenClaw workspace files, skills, and the WebSocket
 RPC protocol.
 .
 Features:
  - Blazing fast C++17 native performance
  - Memory efficient with small footprint
  - OpenClaw compatible workspace and skills
  - Dual protocol: WebSocket RPC + HTTP REST API
  - Multi-provider LLM support (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Qwen)
  - Plugin ecosystem with Node.js sidecar for OpenClaw compatibility
  - MCP (Model Context Protocol) support
  - File system first, no database dependencies
 .
 This package includes the Node.js sidecar for running OpenClaw-compatible
 TypeScript plugins, providing full compatibility with the OpenClaw plugin
 ecosystem.
